      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If we transition to LexSecure without retaining the generative capabilities, the risk to litigation success is significant, particularly in complex cross-border cases. Rule-based systems excel at precedent but fundamentally lack the ability to predict novel legal arguments or adapt to evolving judicial interpretation. Essentially, we are trading predictive nuance for deterministic compliance, which could leave us vulnerable to unforeseen legal shifts.",
      "source": "target",
